  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen double clicking on a Tab in the Main Menu and than moving your cursor above one on the Tabs that have a double click action (Search, Social, Worlds) you will see your menu flickering a lot and hear the click sound playing every ~0.5 seconds.\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n1. Open your Main Menu\n2. Double click and hold on a Tab (e.g. VRChat+ or Help)\n3. Move your cursor above either Worlds, Social or Search (aka dragging through the menu)\nIf you do this you will notice that the Tab is not flickering a lot.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/nozzdz",
